"""${message}

Revision ID: ${up_revision}
Revises: ${down_revision | comma,n}
Create Date: ${create_date}

Autogenerated by `make revision m="${message}"`, then edited by hand. The
autogenerate pass knows about columns and indexes; it knows nothing about the
row-level security, the grants and the triggers that actually protect a tenant
table. Every migration that adds a table with an `org_id` gets those added back
in before it is committed — `make check-rls` fails the build otherwise.
"""

